How spoiled do you want to be?  Pay the Oracle 1000 z and
she might tell you.  There's a specific trick to it.

> I'm
> guessing that grease would protect the helmet for the future, right?

Grease does help protect against further rust damage and it
does protect against more than that in some cases.

> How can I protect the burnable items?

The same way that makes iron weapons/armor rustproof and
repaired does fireproof leather or cloth items.  Fun tidbit -
There are two common types of weapons that end up fireproof
not rustproof.  Once you know which ones there are a small
number of monster types that damage iron-not-wood and
vice versa so that knowledge will make you better against
them.

> What's the best way to deal with
