> Finally, would anyone like to give me a general plan of action for the
> near future?

Your next general targets are going to be the Quest, Ludios
and Medusa.  Read up on what you'll need for your character's
Quest and get that stuff.  Reflection and/or magic resistance is
a must if Ludios exists in your game.  For Medusa you'll need
some method to cross water, reflection, a way to blind yourself
and telepathy.

